Package: zoomriya-base
Version: 13.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: ZOOMRIYA <os@zoomriya.com>
Depends: aide, auditd, avahi-daemon, base-files, btrfs-progs, console-setup, initramfs-tools,
 nftables, snapper, systemd, systemd-boot, systemd-resolved,
 systemd-timesyncd, unattended-upgrades, zstd
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: ZOOMRIYA OS settings
 Makes a Debian 13 install into ZOOMRIYA OS: os-release, the firewall,
 sysctl, journald, name lookups, the network,
 the box's name, the login banner and the message of the day; security
 fixes by themselves, restore points around every update, boot counting
 for new kernels, and restoring the OS from a restore point; the box's
 mDNS name and the setup code for first boot.
